translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_a4461d66:

    "你完全知道你找不到沃尔登但他会找到你开始走小路穿过花园。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_ee468de2:

