translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_c0cf4706:

    "走路后，你看见一团蓝色的花在左转。它很快暴露成是伏登的屈身形式，你向他招手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_8b1119a1:

    "你爬过来，小心哈斯克尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_f7378503:

    e "嘿伍尔顿我买了药没用吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Wuldon_Meeting_Haskell_f458d617:

